{"id":"vnizu","lemma":"внизу","pos":"adv","rank":674,"glosses":["below, underneath","at the foot of, at the bottom of","downstairs (located downstairs)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/bb/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B7%D1%83.ogg/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B7%D1%83.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Моя комната прямо внизу.","en":"My room is just below.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/728249","words":[{"g":"my","l":"мой"},{"g":"room"},{"g":"straight"},null]},{"text":"Что там внизу случилось?","en":"What happened down there?","words":[{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"there"},null,{"g":"to happen","l":"случиться"}]},{"text":"Тут внизу ничего нет.","en":"There's nothing down here.","words":[{"g":"here"},null,{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"no / there isn't"}]},{"text":"Я буду ждать внизу.","en":"I'll be waiting downstairs.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},{"g":"to wait for"},null]},{"text":"Подожди меня внизу.","en":"Wait for me downstairs.","words":[{"g":"to wait","l":"подождать"},{"g":"me","l":"я"},null]}]}